This crate is a Rust port of github.com/dobbo-ca/zstd-go.

The decoder (src/lib.rs, src/bits.rs, src/frame.rs, src/huf.rs, src/literals.rs, src/seq.rs,
src/seqloop.rs, src/xxhash.rs) ports functions of libzstd (facebook/zstd) through zstd-go, and the test fixtures
in tests/data/golden, tests/data/golden-errors and tests/data/decodecorpus come from it. libzstd carries
